# S1: the STALL SHAPE, arm A of the paired ABAB, on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-time-gate (the control: the nine levers, the quad blocks, chunked prefill OFF, audits off): seven seats decode 4k prompts (ignore_eos, 6,000-token budgets) and, once every seat has
# streamed 12 chunks, ONE COLD LONG PROMPT ARRIVES: first about 120,000 tokens (stall8_cold128k), then 253,920 (stall8_cold262k), each in its own run of seven fresh decoders. Recorded per run: the newcomer's time to first token
# (arrival_ttft_s), every seat's longest inter-token gap from the arrival on, and each seat's chunks and ESTIMATED tokens a second INSIDE the arrival's prefill window (arrival to the newcomer's first token): the control freezes
# every decoder, so its window rates are zero. READ: every stream completes, c2_smoke_check clean, no watchdog exit, no fallback. Judge the pair PAIRED, never by unpaired figures; check the load average (no build, no CI push, no
# other job beside it). Then offline: python scripts/ci/levern_compare.py --control <S1 smoke log> --levern <S2 smoke log>: every stream's hashes equal (exit 0) and the two arms' numbers side by side. Duration (estimate): 90 min. Soft.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/lever-n four-card development window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/lever-n and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-lever-n-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/lever-n commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-lever-n-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-time-gate
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,stall8_cold128k,stall8_cold262k
